NAME
    channel - Channel-based input operations

SYNOPSIS

    confctl [global options] inputs channel ls [channel-pattern]

    confctl [global options] inputs channel set [--allow_shared] [--changelog] [--commit] [--editor] [-d|--downgrade] <channels> <role> <rev>

    confctl [global options] inputs channel update [--changelog] [--commit] [--editor] [-d|--downgrade] <channels> [role]

COMMANDS
    ls     - List channels and their role->input mapping (with locked revisions)
    set    - Set inputs referenced by channels for a role to a specific revision
    update - Update inputs referenced by channels (optionally only a single
             role)

